.TH IAXPHONE-GUI 1 "November 2026" "iaxphone 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iaxphone\-gui \- IAX2 softphone window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iaxphone\-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B iaxphone\-gui
is the window of
.BR iaxphone (1):
it registers with the IAX2 server, shows the registration and the current
call, and offers a number entry, a keypad, Call, Answer and Hang up
buttons, a mute box and peak level meters.
.PP
The keypad dials when idle and sends DTMF during a call; a key sounds for
as long as it is held, 100 ms at least, and so is the DTMF held on the
wire. Incoming calls ring on the speaker and show a desktop notification.
.PP
The gear button opens the settings: server, account, caller id,
registration, jitter buffer depth, sound (default devices or none), and
the microphone and speaker to use. They are stored in Fyne's preferences
under
.IR ~/.config/fyne/com.github.ppomes.iaxphone/ ,
the secret included, in clear.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR iaxphone (1)
